<DemoPageHeader Title="Validation: API reference" ComponentName="Fran.Validation" DocSlug="validation">
    Every type, method, and parameter in <code>Fran.Validation</code>, plus each
    input's own validation parameters. See <a href="/validation/wiring">Wiring it
